Description: AetherStack Team Server additions (metapackage)
 Depends on aetherstack-toolkit and documents Team Server extras:
 OIDC IdP (Authentik/Keycloak via Compose profile), reverse proxy,
 and multi-user configuration templates (.env.team.example).
 Auth enforcement is product milestone E1 — this package does not
 enable unsafe LAN binds by itself.
